  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">An easy slip-on silhouette perfect for running errands or lounging around the house, our sporty clog is crafted of our Signature jacquard with smooth leather details. Our Signature Jacquard is made with a blend of 46% recycled polyester and 54% regenerative cotton sourced from farms that use regenerative agricultural practices—those that help to maintain and rejuvenate land, increase biological diversity and soil health, and could lead to increased carbon absorption. It reflects our ongoing commitment to helping reduce our impact on the planet.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Upper Material:</strong> Signature jacquard and leather upper</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Heel / Sole:</strong> Standard</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Official COACH Men Footwear Size Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background: #f8f8f8; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;\">\n          <th style=\"padding: 6px;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding: 6px;\">Fit / Width</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 7</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 6.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 8</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 7.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"b